{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29190","headline":"春日思旧游寄南徐从事刘三复 · 许浑","name":"春日思旧游寄南徐从事刘三复","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风暖曲江花半开，忽思京口共衔杯。\n湘潭云尽暮山出，巴蜀雪消春水来。\n怀玉尚悲迷楚塞，捧金犹羡乐燕台。\n蓟门高处极归思，陇鴈北飞双燕回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}